+ * DSH Desktop: raised from 128 MiB. Re-enabling ASAR makes electron-builder
+ * smart-unpack every package that carries a native payload, and this edition
+ * ships several large ones that must stay physical because they are spawned or
+ * dlopen'd (ASAR cannot serve either): LibreOfficeKit (~191 MiB, an .exe),
+ * @dataiku/uv (~87 MiB, runs python), sharp (~36 MiB), sherpa-onnx (~23 MiB,
+ * a .node binding). The original 128 MiB ceiling was calibrated against
